WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.698
Different length-width-height triples can form boxes with the same volume when their

00:00:04.698 --> 00:00:05.448
products agree.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:13.404
A cuboid has 84 unit cubes and a 3 times 7 base. Find its height. The answer is 4.

00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:17.526
Equal volumes: 84 divided by (3 times 7) equals 4 layers.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:24.523
A box at a school fair holds 128 cubes. Its base measures 8 cubes by 4 cubes. What

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:28.969
height makes another box with the same volume? Pause the video and think.

00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:36.789
A box at a school fair holds 128 cubes. Its base measures 8 cubes by 4 cubes. What

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:42.627
height makes another box with the same volume? The answer is 4. Equal volumes: 128

00:00:42.627 --> 00:00:45.741
divided by (8 times 4) equals 4 layers.
